            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">At the end of your shooting phase, select one target wounded by this unit. That unit must make a leadership check with a -1 penalty. if that test is failed that unit is ensnared. While a unit is ensnared, subtract 2&quot; from its Move characteristic and subtract 2 from Charge rolls made for it.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
